{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Elle","Michèle fait partie de ces femmes que rien ne semble atteindre. À la tête d'une grande entreprise de jeux vidéo, elle gère ses affaires comme sa vie sentimentale : d'une main de fer. Sa vie bascule lorsqu'elle est agressée chez elle par un mystérieux inconnu. Inébranlable, Michèle se met à le traquer en retour. Un jeu étrange s'installe alors entre eux. Un jeu qui, à tout instant, peut dégénérer. (Michèle is one of those women who seems indestructible. Head of a leading video game company, she brings the same ruthless attitude to her love life as she does to her business. Her life is turned upside down when she is attacked in her own home by an unknown assailant. When Michèle resolutely tracks the man down, they are both drawn into a strange and thrilling game - a game that may, at any moment, spiral out of control.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"self-employment","personal trauma","independent home","extended family","motherhood","marriage","infidelity","romance","abuse",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":43,"media":45,"synopsis":48,"production":51,"characters":60,"roles":94,"awards":141,"tags":3},"Film","FR2016_085","fr2016-085-elle",{"native":1,"english":1},{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2016-05-25",2016,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":31},"Paul Verhoeven","paul-verhoeven",1938,0,"Male identifying","Netherlands (the)",[32,39],{"film":33,"year":35,"award":36,"category":37,"result":38},{"slug":16,"title":34},{"native":1},2017,"César du cinéma","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":40,"year":21,"award":42,"category":37,"result":38},{"slug":16,"title":41},{"native":1},"European Film Awards",[44],"Thriller",{"posterUrl":46,"trailerUrl":47},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/233/93/155113/format_page/elle.jpg","ht